# 2023王江涛高分写作 - 大作文图表作文
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语
# 来源: 2023王江涛高分写作
# 描述: 考研英语二大作文图表作文写作模板、高分句型与话题词汇

{{图表作文三段式结构}}{{第一段：描述图表数据+总结趋势；第二段：分析原因；第三段：总结+预测/建议}}{{图表作文是英语二常考题型，包括柱状图、饼状图、折线图、表格等。}}

{{第一段总述句型}}{{As is clearly illustrated/shown in the chart/graph/table, ... / According to the data given in the chart, ...}}{{总述图表内容。例：As is clearly illustrated in the bar chart, the number of people using mobile payments has increased dramatically.}}

{{数据描述-上升}}{{increase/rise/grow/climb/go up/soar/rocket/surge from ... to ... / There is a sharp/steady/dramatic increase in ...}}{{描述数据上升趋势。例：The figure rose sharply from 30% in 2018 to 65% in 2022.}}

{{数据描述-下降}}{{decrease/decline/drop/fall/go down/plunge/plummet from ... to ... / There is a gradual/slight decline in ...}}{{描述数据下降趋势。例：The percentage of people reading newspapers declined gradually from 50% to 20%.}}

{{数据描述-波动}}{{fluctuate between ... and ... / There are ups and downs in ... / The figure remained stable/constant at around ...}}{{描述数据波动或稳定。例：The unemployment rate fluctuated between 4% and 6% over the decade.}}

{{数据描述-占比}}{{account for / make up / constitute / represent / take up + 百分比}}{{描述饼状图占比。例：Online shopping accounts for 45% of total retail sales.}}

{{数据描述-倍数}}{{... is twice/three times as much as ... / ... doubled/tripled compared with ... / ... is ... times that of ...}}{{描述倍数关系。例：The number of internet users in 2022 is three times that of 2012.}}

{{第二段原因分析}}{{Several factors contribute to this phenomenon. / The reasons behind this trend are as follows.}}{{引出原因分析。后续用Firstly, Secondly, Finally等连接。}}

{{原因-经济发展}}{{With the rapid economic growth/development, people's living standards have been greatly improved, leading to ...}}{{经济因素类原因分析。}}

{{原因-政策推动}}{{The government has issued/introduced a series of policies to encourage/support/promote ...}}{{政策因素类原因分析。例：The government has introduced policies to promote the development of e-commerce.}}

{{原因-观念变化}}{{People's attitudes toward ... have changed dramatically. / There is a growing awareness of ...}}{{观念变化类原因分析。例：There is a growing awareness of the importance of environmental protection.}}

{{原因-技术进步}}{{The advancement of technology, especially the widespread use of the internet and smartphones, has made ...}}{{技术进步类原因分析。}}

{{第三段总结预测}}{{In conclusion/To sum up, this trend is likely to continue in the foreseeable future. / It can be predicted that ...}}{{总结并预测趋势。例：It can be predicted that online education will continue to grow in popularity.}}

{{第三段建议}}{{It is advisable for the government/individuals to ... / Measures should be taken to ... / We should take advantage of this trend to ...}}{{提出建议或对策。}}

{{图表作文常用数据表达}}{{the highest/lowest percentage of ... / rank first/last / compared with/in comparison with / as opposed to / in contrast to}}{{数据对比常用表达。}}

{{图表作文常用时间表达}}{{during the period from ... to ... / over the past decade/century / in recent years / from then on / at the turn of the century}}{{时间描述常用表达。}}

{{高分话题词汇-经济类}}{{consumption expenditure消费支出 / disposable income可支配收入 / economic structure经济结构 / supply and demand供需 / market economy市场经济}}{{经济类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分话题词汇-社会类}}{{population aging人口老龄化 / urban-rural gap城乡差距 / employment rate就业率 / social security社会保障 / quality of life生活质量}}{{社会类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分话题词汇-教育类}}{{enrollment rate入学率 / higher education高等教育 / vocational education职业教育 / educational investment教育投入 / academic performance学业表现}}{{教育类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分话题词汇-科技互联网类}}{{internet penetration rate互联网普及率 / e-commerce电子商务 / mobile payment移动支付 / online shopping网购 / digital economy数字经济}}{{科技互联网类话题常考词汇。}}

{{高分句型-数据引用}}{{The data/statistics show(s) that ... / It can be seen from the chart that ... / As the data indicates, ...}}{{引用数据的高级表达。}}

{{高分句型-趋势描述}}{{A closer examination of the chart reveals that ... / What deserves our attention is ... / It is worth noting that ...}}{{深入分析图表的高级表达。}}

{{常见错误提醒}}{{1.数据描述不准确 2.只罗列数据不分析原因 3.时态混乱 4.缺少数据对比 5.结尾缺乏深度}}{{避免常见扣分点。}}
